%% Ray Task Data Flow
%% Commit: d1cce8c9dc8411fad7cfbd619350bec6f19839a3

sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Code
    participant API as Python API
    participant CW as CoreWorker
    participant Raylet as Raylet
    participant GCS as GCS
    participant Worker as Worker Process
    participant Plasma as Object Store

    %% Task Submission
    User->>API: @ray.remote def task()
    User->>API: task.remote(args)
    API->>API: Serialize function + args
    API->>CW: Submit task
    CW->>Raylet: Request worker lease
    Raylet->>GCS: Check resources

    %% Scheduling
    GCS-->>Raylet: Resource info
    Raylet->>Raylet: Schedule task
    Raylet-->>CW: Worker lease granted

    %% Execution
    CW->>Worker: Send task spec
    Worker->>Plasma: Get dependencies
    Plasma-->>Worker: Serialized data
    Worker->>Worker: Execute function
    Worker->>Plasma: Store result
    Worker-->>CW: Task complete

    %% Result Retrieval
    User->>API: ray.get(ref)
    API->>CW: Get object
    CW->>Plasma: Fetch object
    Plasma-->>CW: Serialized result
    CW->>API: Deserialize
    API-->>User: Python object
